@rel_greens
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; foreign_moderation += 1; greens_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); emali_strength += 1; pragmatist_strength += 1; oldleft_dissent += 2; pragmatist_dissent -= 1;

@rel_spd
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; econ_moderation += 1; spd_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); emali_strength += 1; pragmatist_strength += 2; beweli_dissent += 2; oldleft_dissent += 1; pragmatist_dissent -= 2;

@rel_bsw
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; social_moderation += 1; bsw_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); oldleft_strength += 2; oldleft_dissent -= 2; pragmatist_dissent += 2; beweli_dissent += 1;

@rel_cdu
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; foreign_moderation += 1; social_moderation += 1; econ_moderation += 1; cdu_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); beweli_dissent += 4; pragmatist_strength += 3; oldleft_dissent += 1; pragmatist_dissent -= 1; emali_dissent += 1;

@spd_alone
on-arrival: greens_relation -= 1; spd_relation -= 1; beweli_strength += 1;

Whether it is because we *cannot* or *will not*, we do not make ties with other parties at this moment.

